Third-party software in slipbox
===============================

The slipbox program is one file built with `bun build --compile`. Besides
slipbox's own code (MIT, see LICENSE) it contains the software below, each
under its own license. All of it is compatible with MIT.

- The Bun runtime.
- ONNX Runtime, the native library that runs the embedding model.
- The npm packages bundled into the server and into the dashboard, including
  the Inter and JetBrains Mono fonts.

The embedding model (Xenova/bge-small-en-v1.5, MIT) is not part of the
program; it is downloaded from huggingface.co on first start.

